  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Tian Ti mountain, Fairy Bai Hu’s inheritance appears and draws many Gu Immortals. She is a famous righteous path rank six Gu Immortal who owns Hu Immortal blessed land. The ten great sects of Central Continent agree that their Gu Immortals will not strike, and instead send elite disciples to compete for it.",
      "chapters": [
        335
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "char_fairy_bai_hu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land",
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later treats the Central Continent opening as Fairy Bai Hu’s intact rank six inheritance, many times better than the three kings inheritance, and notes that only disciples of the ten great sects can join the contest at Tian Ti mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        337
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "At the site, disciples already speak of the event under the name Hu Immortal Inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        338
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "While ten Gu Immortal divine consciousnesses open the inheritance on Tian Ti mountain, elite disciples including Feng Jin Huang, Xiao Qi Xing, and Ying Sheng Ji enter through the gatehouse. Fang Yuan, reading prior-life memory, calls Hu Immortal Inheritance on Tian Ti mountain a true Gu Immortal blessed land many times more precious than three kings inheritance. Inside, a fox-tailed girl tells each entrant that only the first person to ascend a mountain peak can obtain her.",
      "chapters": [
        365
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-rules-and-land-spirit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jin_huang",
        "char_xiao_qi_xing",
        "char_ying_sheng_ji"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lord Sky Crane tells Fang Zheng that Hu Immortal Inheritance is an intact Gu Immortal Inheritance with only one inheritor, and that the girl is the inheritance: the first to reach the peak becomes her master. The climb is on Dang Hun Mountain inside the blessed land; Hu Immortal’s will seals mortal Gu so climbers rely on physical strength, and time in the blessed land runs five times faster than outside. The inheritance has a land spirit, so even a Gu Immortal cannot take the land by force without risking self-destruction of the blessed land; that is why the ten sects send elite disciples. Lord Sky Crane names the girl as Hu Immortal land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        366
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "contest-rules-and-land-spirit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lord_sky_crane",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "loc_dang_hun_mountain",
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Using Fixed Immortal Travel, Fang Yuan appears on the peak one step before Feng Jin Huang, kicks her down, and the land spirit addresses him as master. He treats the haul as the entire Hu Immortal blessed land plus Fixed Immortal Travel.",
      "chapters": [
        405
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-holder",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_fixed_immortal_travel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan immediately commands the land spirit to close the blessed land. He Feng Yang of Immortal Crane Sect then claims Fang Yuan as a sect member so the other nine sects drop out of the contest, even though the belonging of Hu Immortal Inheritance would otherwise reopen among all ten.",
      "chapters": [
        407
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "closing-the-land",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_feng_yang",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later notes that he snatched Hu Immortal Inheritance in front of the ten sects’ Gu Immortals.",
      "chapters": [
        408
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-the-seizure",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
